  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the 2018 electoral cycle in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the delivery of free and fair Presidential, Parliamentary and Local Government elections in Sierra Leone in 2018, with effective citizen oversight and participation. Support will be delivered through a contribution to two UNDP-managed multi-donor projects for the elections, and via a DFID-managed Accountable Grant to a consortium of Civil Society Organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
